From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gavin John <gavinnjohn@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 11:53:51 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Report command counts when each task starts

The build's started and maximum command counts only reached clients
inside throttled, pre-formatted status messages, so clients could not
show which task each count belongs to. Snapshot them when a top-level
task starts and send them with its BUILD_TASK_STARTED message, so
clients can print ninja-style "[started/total] description" lines.
---
