 Sources/SWBBuildSystem/BuildOperation.swift   | 13 ++++--
 Sources/SWBBuildSystem/CleanOperation.swift   |  2 +-
 .../SWBProtocol/BuildOperationMessages.swift  | 42 +++++++++++++++++--
 .../SWBTestSupport/BuildOperationTester.swift |  3 +-
 ...WBServiceConsoleBuildCommandProtocol.swift | 29 ++++++++++++-
 .../SwiftBuild/SWBuildMessage+Protocol.swift  |  2 +-
 7 files changed, 83 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

